{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15368","headline":"送从兄赴洪州别驾兄善琴 · 李端","name":"送从兄赴洪州别驾兄善琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"援琴兼爱竹，遥夜在湘沅。\n鹤舞月将下，乌啼霜正繁。\n乱流喧橘岸，飞雪暗荆门。\n佐郡无辞屈，其如相府恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}